  "title": "Ben’s Diary — Having a meal",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-05-19",
  "synopsis": "Ben writes in his diary about going to a restaurant with Lili.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/422/d7e1fa17b7ec7e1e1ae6858035a7043f54d119c6.mp3?1589790981",
  "series": {
